WEBVTT

00:00:58.276 --> 00:01:00.996
who spent time
occupying trees and tunnels,

00:01:01.036 --> 00:01:05.436
and he was the main face of climate action
in the United Kingdom.

00:01:06.196 --> 00:01:08.636
But, you know, things change.

00:01:09.756 --> 00:01:14.196
I remember being on a flight
in the late 2000s

00:01:14.236 --> 00:01:17.996
and watching Al Gore’s film
“An Inconvenient Truth.”

00:01:18.716 --> 00:01:21.196
And I rarely watch an entire film,

00:01:21.236 --> 00:01:25.396
but this one I watched twice
on the same flight.

00:01:26.396 --> 00:01:28.956
And I remember sitting
on the plane afterwards

00:01:28.996 --> 00:01:31.756
thinking about my young daughters